### ============================================================
### BankStatement Microservices — API Collection
### Use com VS Code REST Client extension ou IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ============================================================

### ─── Health Checks ──────────────────────────────────────────

### Orchestrator Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

###

### Account Health
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health

###

### Ledger Health
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/health

###

### Transaction Health
GET http://localhost:8083/api/transactions/health

###

### Exchange Health
GET http://localhost:8084/api/exchange/health

###

### Statement Health
GET http://localhost:8085/api/statements/health

###


### ─── Transaction Service (Go :8083) ──────────────────────────

### Criar Transferência BRL entre contas
POST http://localhost:8083/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "account-joao-001",
  "targetAccountId": "account-maria-002",
  "transactionType": "TRANSFER_OUT",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "description": "Pagamento aluguel"
}

###

### Criar Depósito USD
POST http://localhost:8083/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "account-joao-001",
  "transactionType": "DEPOSIT",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Depósito em dólares"
}

###

### Criar Câmbio BRL → USD
POST http://localhost:8083/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "account-joao-001",
  "transactionType": "CURRENCY_EXCHANGE",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "targetCurrency": "USD",
  "description": "Câmbio para viagem"
}

###

### Criar Saque
POST http://localhost:8083/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "account-maria-002",
  "transactionType": "WITHDRAWAL",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "description": "Saque ATM"
}

###


### ─── Orchestrator Service (Java :8080) ─────────────────────

### Iniciar Saga via Orchestrator
POST http://localhost:8080/api/saga/transaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "account-joao-001",
  "targetAccountId": "account-maria-002",
  "transactionType": "TRANSFER_OUT",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "currency": "BRL",
  "description": "Transferência via saga"
}

###

### Listar todas as sagas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/saga/all

###

### Status de uma saga (substituir {sagaId})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/saga/status/{sagaId}

###

### Outbox — Eventos pendentes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outbox/pending

###

### Outbox — Eventos com falha
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outbox/failed

###

### Outbox — Estatísticas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outbox/stats

###

### Outbox — Eventos de uma saga
GET http://localhost:8080/api/outbox/saga/{sagaId}

###

### Métricas Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/prometheus

###


### ─── Account Service (Java :8081) ──────────────────────────

### Listar todas as contas
GET http://localhost:8081/api/accounts

###

### Detalhes da conta do João (com saldos)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/accounts/account-joao-001

###

### Detalhes da conta da Maria
GET http://localhost:8081/api/accounts/account-maria-002

###

### Métricas Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus

###


### ─── Ledger Service (Java :8082) ──────────────────────────

### Listar entradas do ledger
GET http://localhost:8082/api/ledger/entries

###

### Entradas do ledger por conta
GET http://localhost:8082/api/ledger/entries/account-joao-001

###

### Métricas Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8082/actuator/prometheus

###


### ─── Exchange Service (Python :8084) ──────────────────────

### Todas as taxas de câmbio
GET http://localhost:8084/api/exchange/rates

###

### Taxa BRL → USD
GET http://localhost:8084/api/exchange/rate/BRL/USD

###

### Taxa EUR → GBP
GET http://localhost:8084/api/exchange/rate/EUR/GBP

###

### Converter 1000 BRL para USD
GET http://localhost:8084/api/exchange/convert/BRL/USD/1000

###

### Converter 500 EUR para GBP
GET http://localhost:8084/api/exchange/convert/EUR/GBP/500

###

### Métricas Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8084/metrics

###


### ─── Statement Service (Node.js :8085) ────────────────────

### Extrato completo do João
GET http://localhost:8085/api/statements/account-joao-001

###

### Extrato do João filtrado por BRL
GET http://localhost:8085/api/statements/account-joao-001?currency=BRL

###

### Extrato do João paginado
GET http://localhost:8085/api/statements/account-joao-001?limit=10&offset=0

###

### Extrato completo da Maria
GET http://localhost:8085/api/statements/account-maria-002

###

### Saldos da Maria
GET http://localhost:8085/api/statements/account-maria-002/balances

###

### Métricas Prometheus
GET http://localhost:8085/metrics

###


### ─── Observabilidade ─────────────────────────────────────

### Prometheus — Targets
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/targets

###

### Prometheus — Query: serviços UP
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=up

###

### Prometheus — Query: sagas totais
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=saga_total

###

### Prometheus — Query: outbox pendentes
GET http://localhost:9090/api/v1/query?query=outbox_events_pending

###
